    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        LongSearchEval: Evaluating Long-Horizon Web Search Capabilities of Large Language Models via a Trajectory-Aware <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agent</span> Framework with Failure-Node Localization
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
