    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Revocation Is Not Complete at Receipt: An Executable <span class="search-hit mathjax">Outcome</span> Contract for Distributed <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agent</span>-Tool Gateways
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+L">Lifei Liu</a>, 
      
