    </p>
    
    <p class="abstract mathjax">
      <span class="search-hit">Abstract</span>:
      <span class="abstract-short has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="2610.15163v1-abstract-short" style="display: inline;">
        &hellip;to information and communication. SANZARU examines this gap through cooperative bomb-defusal puzzles adapted from BOMBANANA! (Lefto Studio, 2026). Task information and action <span class="search-hit mathjax">authority</span> are divided among three&hellip;
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('2610.15163v1-abstract-full').style.display = 'inline'; document.getElementById('2610.15163v1-abstract-short').style.display = 'none';">&#9661; More</a>
      </span>
      <span class="abstract-full has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="2610.15163v1-abstract-full" style="display: none;">
        A language model&#39;s ability to solve a task individually does not ensure that a team can solve it under unequal access to information and communication. SANZARU examines this gap through cooperative bomb-defusal puzzles adapted from BOMBANANA! (Lefto Studio, 2026). Task information and action <span class="search-hit mathjax">authority</span> are divided among three <span class="search-hit mathjax">agents</span>: one cannot hear, another cannot speak, and the third cannot see. The benchmark contains 120 puzzle instances across seven families, each targeting a distinct coordination ability. Across 1512 episodes, 7 models achieve an overall success rate of 49%, ranging from 20% to 86% under the evaluated configurations. Teams develop or adopt diverse communication protocols, from simple gesture codes to Morse and encodings of entire manuals. Yet trace analysis attributes about 60% of 771 team losses to communication, and <span class="search-hit mathjax">agents</span> attempt to use channels unavailable to their teammates despite explicit role instructions. Together, task <span class="search-hit mathjax">outcomes</span> and interaction traces enable evaluation of both collaborative performance and perspective taking throughout cooperation. The benchmark is available at https://github.com/markli404/sanzaru-benchmark.
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('2610.15163v1-abstract-full').style.display = 'none'; document.getElementById('2610.15163v1-abstract-short').style.display = 'inline';">&#9651; Less</a>
      </span>
    </p>
    

