    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Compromise Is Not Consequence: Evaluating Task-Scoped <span class="search-hit mathjax">Authorization</span> in LLM <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agents</span> with Paired Replay
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
